  "goodToKnow": "Die Referenz is a reference: Referenzen angeben (to give references), eine Referenz auf ein anderes Werk, der Referenzwert. In German applications, the key document is das Arbeitszeugnis, a written job reference that employers are legally required to issue, with its own coded language: stets zu unserer vollsten Zufriedenheit means top marks. Das Referat is a student presentation. Plural: die Referenzen."
